---

This toolkit automates a tethered jailbreak on hardware you own. It ships no
Apple code, no keys and no decrypted firmware: components are fetched from
Apple's own servers with the tooling in `tools/` and `fetch_components.py`.
Damage to a device is your own responsibility; see SECURITY.md.
